# Line endings are LF in the working tree on every platform, not only in the
# repository. That is not a style preference here: docs/wire-protocol.md is
# generated and then compared to the committed copy byte for byte, and Windows
# checkouts default to converting text files to CRLF. The check then fails with
# "out of date, from line 1", printing two lines that look identical because the
# only difference is a carriage return nobody can see.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Left exactly as they are.
*.png binary
*.ttf binary
